1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,059
At the fixed end, the string cannot move.

2
00:00:03,059 --> 00:00:07,070
The wall pulls back on it, and the pulse comes back upside down.

3
00:00:07,070 --> 00:00:11,653
Reflection at a fixed end reverses the phase by pi.

4
00:00:11,653 --> 00:00:19,973
Send a continuous wave instead, and the reflected wave overlaps the incoming one all along the string.

